  "bio": "Welcome to DamaNegra Tattoo Club, where the art of ink meets understated elegance in the heart of Salamanca. Specializing in minimalist designs and expressive lettering, our resident artists @patrighdez & @kay.inks masterfully craft personalized tattoos in a welcoming, creative atmosphere. Book your appointment to experience the fusion of intimate artistry and impeccable precision that defines the DamaNegra Tattoo Club experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nEstudio de tatuaje (Salamanca)\n📲 639747232 y 923095933\nResidentes @depablostattoos @patrighdez\n📍C/VAN DYCK 35",
